Hi, Porcunipiners!

We have a fresh new update for you!

-New taunt animations. That's right, you can be vocal and weird in game by pressing Y or Spacebar;
-Winner Crown for the winning player in Arena games;
-Art improvements on the main menu and score HUD;
-...some minor issues fixed.

Do you love cool stuff? We do, so we're working on lots of that for future updates. Stay tuned :)

-Big Green Pillow Team

